SC,0004
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1788445451
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AUber launches UK's first robotaxis with
OL,4,Aa driver - here's what it's like to
OL,5,Aride in one
OL,6,
OL,7,FUber said it surveyed London-based
OL,8,Fcustomers via the app and more than
OL,9,F100,000 said they would choose a
OL,10,Fself-driving taxi if one was available,
OL,11,Fdespite incidents of driverless rides
OL,12,Fmalfunctioning in US cities where they
OL,13,Falready operate.
OL,15,FAs I found out when I became the first
OL,16,FUK journalist to hail one, it was
OL,17,Fmostly smooth but the safety driver did
OL,18,Fintervene on one occasion.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
